WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.100
Fibonacci is one point in a universe of two-step recurrences.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:09.600
Two coefficients and two seeds can produce growth or oscillation.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:15.800
The plotted terms expose how rules and seeds shape each trajectory.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:20.500
A companion matrix advances the entire two-number state.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:26.200
Characteristic roots usually control the long-run behavior.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:30.700
When the roots merge, a linear factor in n appears.

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:34.900
Coefficients choose the machine; seeds choose the start.
